 "summary": "The new inverse-limit topology on `Perfection`, the continuity of `teichmuller\u2080`, the n-th-coordinate formula for `quotientMulEquiv.symm` and the discrete-quotient lemma for `IsAdic` have no counterpart in pinned Mathlib or TauCeti. The PR reuses Mathlib's `quotientMulEquiv`/`teichmuller\u2080_sModEq`/`QuotientAddGroup.discreteTopology_iff` and deletes uniformTilt's private `isEmbedding_val` in favour of the shared `Perfection.isEmbedding_val`.",
